<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 19:57:18 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>纳税人仍每周支付 160 万美元，让 420 名电台工作人员失业</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/trump-taxpayers-1-6-million-week-420-radio-staffers/</link><description>美国全球媒体署无法记录其在 2025 年倾销的美国之音 99% 的设备。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298313670-e1791224301801.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 18:30:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/trump-taxpayers-1-6-million-week-420-radio-staffers/</guid></item><item><title>亚马逊对数据中心强烈反对的回应：10亿美元用于社区大学和家庭能源升级</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/amazon-data-center-community-college-investment/</link><description>该公司表示，由于超大规模企业面临社区对数据中心的强烈反对，该公司还将支付职业培训和能效升级费用。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2292181303-e1791221902306.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 17:46:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/amazon-data-center-community-college-investment/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗的货币正在被消灭，因为该政权即将耗尽石油可供出售，甚至无法从客户那里获得资金</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/iran-currency-rial-dollar-record-low-blockade-oil-revenue-payments/</link><description>“我们甚至无法从我们提供商品的国家取出自己的钱，更不用说用这些资金来支付世界另一个角落的其他人了。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2292608010-e1791057731513.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 21:40:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/iran-currency-rial-dollar-record-low-blockade-oil-revenue-payments/</guid></item><item><title>Nvidia 支持的 Reflection AI 推出了其第一个开放模型 Beam。这是否是美国与中国竞争的最佳机会？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/reflection-ai-unveils-beam-a-new-us-based-open-source-model-to-compete-with-china/</link><description>这家总部位于纽约的公司已经与多个美国政府机构达成了交易，并签署了价值数十亿美元的计算协议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2266727338-e1791215800670.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 19:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/reflection-ai-unveils-beam-a-new-us-based-open-source-model-to-compete-with-china/</guid></item><item><title>纽约证券交易所所有者和加密货币交易所 OKX 寻求美国证券交易委员会 (SEC) 批准进行代币化美国股票交易</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/nyse-owner-crypto-exchange-okx-sec-clearance-tokenized-stock-trading/</link><description>OKXICE 此举是在前纽约州州长安德鲁·科莫 (Andrew Cuomo) 成为联合主席三个月后做出的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2283486257-e1791220492159.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 17:24:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/nyse-owner-crypto-exchange-okx-sec-clearance-tokenized-stock-trading/</guid></item><item><title>工人们担心人工智能会扼杀就业机会。相反，它可能会增加他们的薪水：72% 的雇主表示他们会为人工智能技能支付更多费用</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/workers-fear-ai-kill-jobs-instead-could-boost-paychecks-72-employers-pay-more-for-ai-skills/</link><description>Robert Half 表示，72% 的老板会提高拥有人工智能技能的员工的薪酬，而硅谷的求职者最有可能获得更高的收入。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2238265658-e1791211357771.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 14:58:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/workers-fear-ai-kill-jobs-instead-could-boost-paychecks-72-employers-pay-more-for-ai-skills/</guid></item><item><title>随着长期债务进入波动新时代，就连“债券之王”比尔·格罗斯也警告“不要持有债券”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/04/bond-king-bill-gross-long-term-debt-volatility-treasury-yields/</link><description>“为‘你所习惯的’股市的结束和基准10年期国债价格的更大波动做好准备。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1093780842-e1791134775483.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 17:34:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/04/bond-king-bill-gross-long-term-debt-volatility-treasury-yields/</guid></item><item><title>工作仅仅几年，Z 世代就已经是最担心人工智能让他们的退休生活脱轨的一代——51% 的人担心这会削减他们的储蓄</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/gen-z-retirement-worries-in-age-of-ai-new-survey-tiaa-run-out-of-money-career-disruption-personal-finance-advice/</link><description>随着人工智能扰乱职业道路，Z 世代已经比千禧一代或 X 一代更担心是否有足够的钱来度过他们的黄金岁月。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2274936377-e1791210639870.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 15:18:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/gen-z-retirement-worries-in-age-of-ai-new-survey-tiaa-run-out-of-money-career-disruption-personal-finance-advice/</guid></item><item><title>美国页岩油高管不知道石油市场何时会跌落悬崖</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/strategic-petroleum-reserve-minimum-level-spr-tank-bottoms-crude-oil-prices/</link><description>虽然超过一半的人认为剩余利润可观，但三分之一的石油高管认为 SPR 已经低于或接近底部。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1434808195-e1791206977526.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:36:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/05/strategic-petroleum-reserve-minimum-level-spr-tank-bottoms-crude-oil-prices/</guid></item><item><title>波斯湾石油流量恢复到战前水平，但随着美国向中东部署更多舰艇和海军陆战队，伊朗可能采取“焦土行动”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/04/persian-gulf-oil-flows-prewar-levels-iran-scorched-earth-campaign-us-aircraft-carrier-marines/</link><description>“这是每个真正关注该地区及其动态的人所担心的。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/9977428-e1791139121211.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 20:03:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/04/persian-gulf-oil-flows-prewar-levels-iran-scorched-earth-campaign-us-aircraft-carrier-marines/</guid></item></channel></rss>